{"id":"623673","name":"红糖核桃馒头","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/623673/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"1000g"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"100g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"440g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"6g"}],"sub":[{"name":"核桃","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克红糖称好。","img":"images/623673/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入温水220克，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/623673/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入酵母3克，搅拌均匀，倒入面包机内胆中。","img":"images/623673/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入500克面粉，按揉面功能揉面。","img":"images/623673/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉好的面团放入密封容器发酵。以上五个步骤再重复一次，就是1000克面粉的量。","img":"images/623673/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发好的面团。","img":"images/623673/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"排气。","img":"images/623673/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成长条。","img":"images/623673/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切成馒头。","img":"images/623673/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"馒头中间切一刀，大概1cm深，摆入蒸锅中。二次发酵二十分钟。","img":"images/623673/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"核桃仁切碎。","img":"images/623673/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"与红糖和面粉混合均匀。","img":"images/623673/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"混合好的样子。","img":"images/623673/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"馒头二次发酵好。","img":"images/623673/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入红糖核桃馅。开火蒸，水开蒸十五分钟，关火虚蒸五分钟。","img":"images/623673/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/623673/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}